// Pixel art for the icon theme: a 3x5 dot-matrix micro-font for labels and 5x5 emblems.
// Everything is drawn on the integer pixel grid, so icons stay razor sharp at 16 px on Windows and
// Linux alike (SVG icons cannot rely on system fonts).

